      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nThe DSV4 draft-extend CUDA graph prologue translated full KV-cache locations into SWA locations with two GPU launches on every replay: an int64 mapping gather followed by an int32 cast. This is a latency-sensitive captured path, so the two operations can be expressed more directly as one kernel.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- Compiled the index select + int32 casting with torch compile during capturing\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nmain:\r\n<img width=\"1407\" height=\"325\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fba63560-2dca-46b1-9078-d6dc1f515ca6\" />\r\n\r\nPR:\r\n<img width=\"1164\" height=\"360\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41694528-9548-433b-8dc2-4f5977b0616c\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Format the changed code with Black and isort.\r\n- [x] Add unit tests for the fused kernel and backend routing.\r\n- [x] No documentation update is required for this internal kernel optimization.\r\n- [ ] Add speed benchmark and profiling results.\r\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\r\n\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #30799229529](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/30799229529)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #30799229319](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/30799229319)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
